  "instructions": [
    "In a shallow dish mix flour, shio-koji powder, paprika, salt, and pepper.",
    "Place a chicken breast in the flour mixture, coat well, and dip it in water, then coat again in the flour mixture.",
    "Heat butter in a large non-stick skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Grill the coated chicken for 5 minutes on each side or until it reaches 165°F (74°C) and is cooked through.",
    "Thinly slice the grilled chicken into bite-sized pieces.",
    "Serve the chicken with dill pickles on the side or mixed with the chicken."
